  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To meet immediate humanitarian needs in the wake of the September 2018 earthquake and tsunami in Sulawesi, Indonesia is a component of Humanitarian Response to the 2018 Earthquake and Tsunami in Sulawesi, Indonesia reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;3,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
